    (3, 1, 5, 'Replaced three tools on day one.', '2026-04-01 09:00:00'),
    (1, 2, 5, 'Opens faster than the terminal client I was using.', '2026-04-02 09:00:00'),
    (6, 3, 4, 'Wish the EXPLAIN diagram exported to SVG.', '2026-04-03 09:00:00'),
    (2, 4, 5, 'The deferred commit is the whole reason I switched.', '2026-04-04 09:00:00'),
    (4, 5, 4, 'Good course, assumes you know joins already.', '2026-04-05 09:00:00'),
    (5, 6, 3, 'Solid book, a little dated on clustering.', '2026-04-06 09:00:00'),
    (7, 7, 5, 'Worth it for the index chapter alone.', '2026-04-07 09:00:00'),
    (9, 8, 4, 'Does what it says, no subscription.', '2026-04-08 09:00:00'),
    (11, 9, 5, 'Migrations that finally survive review.', '2026-04-09 09:00:00'),
    (12, 10, 4, 'Small tool, saves a real chore.', '2026-04-10 09:00:00'),
    (8, 11, 5, 'Every DBA on the team bought a copy.', '2026-04-11 09:00:00'),
    (10, 12, 3, 'Fine, but I already had most of this scripted.', '2026-04-12 09:00:00');
